notes:        Screenshot of the FilmCraft app itself (Editing workspace, demo project) captured with the app's own ui.screenshot control command; status strip cropped, downscaled to 2400 px. All footage shown is procedurally generated by crates/media (demo scenes); all icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1). Contains no Adobe artwork.
